{"id":"ce9dbd1a2da08015","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-index-set.md","title":"Index Set","display":"df-index-set — Index Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-index-set","aliases":["68-df-index-set"],"display":"df-index-set — Index Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-natural-number]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§16 index-set definition pp.59,62 / PDF 68,71","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-index-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-index-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-index-set — Index Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3368c1852f2a1aa0\" href=\"?note=3368c1852f2a1aa0\" title=\"68-df-natural-number\">68-df-natural-number</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§16 index-set definition pp.59,62 / PDF 68,71"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,f\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,f\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndexSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{IndexSet}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal C}:=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:W_e\\in\\mathcal C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_{\\mathcal C}:=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:W_e\\in\\mathcal C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndexSet}(I)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall e,f\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e=W_f\\Longrightarrow(e\\in I\\leftrightarrow f\\in I)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IndexSet}(I)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall e,f\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e=W_f\\Longrightarrow(e\\in I\\leftrightarrow f\\in I)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndexSet}(I_{\\mathcal C}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IndexSet}(I_{\\mathcal C}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §16，印刷 p.59 / PDF p.68；原书 p.62 / PDF p.71 还将一个 RE 度的指标集定义为该度中 RE 集合的指标集。第二式显式表达索引不变性，第三式由第一式直接推出；同一集合的不同程序索引必须同进同出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"3368c1852f2a1aa0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}$，$I\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,f\\in\\mathbb N$。$W_e$、$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。$I_{\\mathcal C}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IndexSet}$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,f\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndexSet}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal C}:=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:W_e\\in\\mathcal C\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndexSet}(I)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall e,f\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e=W_f\\Longrightarrow(e\\in I\\leftrightarrow f\\in I)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndexSet}(I_{\\mathcal C}).","display":true}],"bytes":1247,"backlinks":[{"id":"110d5bcf01ae5849","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}$，$\\emptyset\\subsetneq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathrm{RE}$。$I_{\\mathcal C}$ 见 [[68-df-index-set]]，$\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-index-set]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-3